      {
        lead: 'OFX and QFX files',
        text: 'Import the statement files your bank lets you download, on every plan. Overlapping statements are matched by transaction ID.',
      },
      { lead: 'CSV and PDF statements', text: 'A CSV importer with column mapping, and AI parsing for PDF statements.' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Portfolios, loans and net worth',
    items: [
      { lead: 'Portfolios', text: 'Holdings in stocks, ETFs and crypto, with cost basis, returns and dividends.' },
